O CERTAIN CONTRACTS WHO WERE UNABLE TO\n\nPERFORM CONTRACTUAL OBLIGATIONS DUE TO COVID - 19\n\nCIRCUMSTANCES AND FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR\n\nINCIDENTAL THERETO."
