    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri BalabhivurdhiWardana Samithiya (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to establish, equip and maintain a pre-school and alibrary ;\n\n(b)to engage in the dissemination of the Dhamma,internationally ;\n\nPreamble\n\nIncorporationof the SriBalabhivurdhiWardanaSamithiya\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n2Sri Balabhivurdhi Wardana Samithiya(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(c)to preserve and disseminate the BuddhistPhilosophy and the Buddhist way of life ;\n\n(d)to establish friendly relations with other Buddhistorganizations in Sri Lanka and abroad ;\n\n(e)to assist financially by granting scholarships orotherwise the voluntary workers and others who areengaged in the attainment of the objects of theCorporation ;\n\n(f)to established and maintain libraries, to subscribefor and issue books, journals, souvenirs andperiodicals and to provide such other services asmay be deemed desirable for attaining the objectsof the Corporation ;\n\n(g)to collaborate or participate, with any otherinstitution or organisation, whether foreign or local,having objects similar to those of the Corporation ;\n\n(h)to sponsor and conduct conferences, seminars,workshops, group studies and lectures in Sri Lankaand elsewhere in furtherance of the objects of theCorporation ;\n\n(i)to print, publish and distribute books, journals,leaflets, newspapers and magazines which theCorporation may consider desirable for thepromotion and advancement of its objects ; and\n\n(j)to do such other acts, deeds and things as may benecessary, incidental or conducive to theaccomplishment of all or any of the objects of theCorporation."
