    "chunk_size_bytes": 1572,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 33]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Buddhika Pathirana, M. P.for Matara District on 24th of February, 2021\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 16, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nINSTITUTE OF WORLD LIFE LINE YOGA(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Institute of World Life Line Yoga\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Institute of World Life Line Yoga (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationthe Instituteof World LifeLine Yoga\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTE OF WORLD LIFE LINEYOGA\n\nWHERE an Institute called and known as the \u201cInstitute ofWorld Life Line Yoga\u201d has heretofore been formed inSri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidInstitute according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the objects andmatters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Institute of World LifeLine Yoga (Incorporation) Act, No. 2021."
  },
