    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 28]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Amarakeerthi Athukorala, M. P.for Polonnaruwa District on 23rd of February, 2021\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 10, 2021)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nROSHAN RANASINGHE JANASAHANAFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Roshan Ranasinghe Janasahana Foundation\n\nPrice : Rs. 17.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Roshan Ranasinghe JanasahanaFoundation (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ROSHAN RANASINGHEJANASAHANA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the \u201cRoshanRanasinghe Janasahana Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenformed at No. 829/1/B, Hospital Junction, Polonnaruwa ofPolonnaruwa District in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out and transacting all objects andmatters connected with the said Foundation according tothe rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Roshan RanasingheJanasahana Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021."
  },
