    "chunk_text": "10.No member of the Corporation of the Corporationshall for the purpose of discharging the debts and liabilitiesof the Corporation or for any other purpose, be liable tomake any contribution exceeding the among of suchmembership fees as may be due from him to the Corporation.\n\n12.(1) The Board of Directors of the Corporation shallcause proper accounts to be kept of all moneys received andexpended by the Corporation.\n\nFund of theCorporation\n\n35\n\nCorporationmay holdpropertymovable andimmovable\n\nLimitation ofliabilities ofmembers\n\nPropertyremaining ondissolution\n\nAudit andaccounts oftheCorporation\n\n6Roshan Ranasinghe JanasahanaFoundation (Incorporation)\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\nSaving of therights of theRepublic andothers\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nSeal of theCorporation\n\n(2) The financial year of the Corporation shall be thecalendar year.\n\n(3) The accounts of the Corporation shall be examinedand audited at least once in every year by an auditor orauditors appointed by the Board of Directors.\n\n13.The seal of the Corporation shall not be affixed toany instrument whatsoever except in the presence ofChairman of the Corporation and one member of theCorporation and one member of the Board of Directors suchnumber of person as may be provided for in the rules in forcefor the time being of the Corporation, who shall sign theirnames to the instrument in token of their presence and suchsigning shall be independent of signing of any person as awitness.\n\n14.Nothing in this Act contained shall prejudice oraffect the rights of the Republic or of anybody politic, orcorporate or of any other persons except such as arementioned in this Act and those claiming by, from or underthem.\n\n15.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.\n\n7Roshan Ranasinghe JanasahanaFoundation (Incorporation)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
