    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nPart II of February 12, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 16. 02. 2021)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon.Buddhika Pathirana, M. P. for Matara District\n\nINSTITUTE OF WORLD LIFE LINE YOGA(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Institute of World Life Line Yoga\n\n1Institute of World Life Line Yoga (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationthe Instituteof World LifeLine Yoga\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTE OF WORLD LIFE LINEYOGA\n\nWHERE an Institute called and known as the \u201cInstitute ofWorld Life Line Yoga\u201d has heretofore been formed inSri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidInstitute according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the objects andmatters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Institute of World LifeLine Yoga (Incorporation) Act, No. 2021.\n\n2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so may persons as now are members ofthe \u201cInstitute of World Life Line Yoga\u201d (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted asmembers shall be a body corporate (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession under the nameand style of the \u201cInstitute of World Life Line Yoga\u201d and bythat name may sue and be sued in all courts, with full powerand authority to have and use a common seal and alter thesame at its pleasure."
