    "chunk_size_bytes": 2016,
    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cRuhunu Awakening\u201d Organization (hereinafter referred toas the \u201cOrganization\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted asmembers of the Corporation hereby constituted, shall be abody corporate with perpetual succession, under the nameand style of the \u201cRuhunu Awakening\u201d Organization(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by thatname may sue and be sued and shall have full power andauthority to have and use a common seal and to alter the sameat its pleasure.\n\n(a) to grant aid and support physically and qualitativelyto relevant institutions in order to facilitate schoolchildren and university students to carry out theirstudies effectively;\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationof theRuhunuAwakeningOrganization\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n2Ruhunu Awakening Organization(Incorporation)\n\n(b) to identify inborn talents of students and youths atthe rural, district and provincial levels in the fieldsof sports, literary and arts and to inspire them toharness their inborn talents through the provisionof the required infrastructure facilities for thispurpose;\n\n(c) to provide for displaying and evalating skills ofschool children and university students and to conferawards and certificates to children with talents inorder to promote their cultural skills;\n\n(d) to implement special training programmes whichwill enable the creation of a young generation whoappreciate and practice values, norms and ethics;\n\n(e) to implement practical programmes for promotingphysical capabilities of student population throughsanitation and health programmes and sports cumphysical exercise programmes;\n\n(f) to organize and operate educational tours,shramadana campaigns and workshops in order toinculate feelings on Sri Lankan heritage,environment, wildlife, population and patriotism;\n\n(g) to provide assistance and to encourage formingscouts groups and platoons in schools;"
