    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPrice : Rs. 17.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\nPart II of February 12, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 15. 02. 2021)\n\nSATHYA SRI GHANAPATHI BHAKTHI JANASEWA FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Sathya Sri Ghanapathi Bhakthi Jana SewaFoundation\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Tissa Attanayake, M.P.\n\n1Sathya Sri Ghanapathi Bhakthi Jana Sewa Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SATHYA SRI GHANAPATHI BHAKTHIJANA SEWA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a society called and known as the \u201cSathya SriGhanapathi Bhakthi Jana Sewa Foundation\u201d has heretoforebeen established in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said society according to the rules agreed to by themembers:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said society has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was established and has applied to be incorporatedand it will be for the public advantage to grant the saidapplication.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sathya Sri GhanapathiBhakthi Jana Sewa Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2021."
  },
  {
