    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of January 08, 2021\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 11.01.2021)\n\nSRI SHAKYASINGHARAMA VIHARASTHAKARYASADHAKA SANVIDANAYA(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Sri Shakyasingharama Viharastha KaryasadhakaSanvidanaya\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Yadamini Gunawardena, M. P.\n\nPrice : Rs. 17.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Sri Shakyasinharama Viharastha KaryasadhakaSanvidanaya (Incorporation)\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI SHAKYASINHARAMAVIHARASTHA KARYASADHAKA SANVIDANAYA\n\nWHEREAS an Organization called and known as the\u201cSri Shakyasinharama Viharastha KaryasadhakaSanvidanaya\u201d has heretofore been created for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Organization:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Organization has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters of the Organization and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri ShakyasinharamaViharastha Karyasadhaka Sanvidanaya (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2021."
  },
