    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 16, 2020\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 20.10.2020)\n\nEVIDENCE (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice\n\nto amend the Evidence Ordinance (Chapter 14)\n\nPrice : Rs. 17.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClauses 2 to 25 : These clauses make provisions to amend the Evidence Ordinance(Chapter 14) by replacing outdated words and expressions appearing in that Ordinancewith the words and expressions which reflect the contemporary position.\n\nEvidence (Amendment)1\n\n20\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 45/2016\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE EVIDENCE ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 14)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Evidence (Amendment)Act, No. of 2020.\n\n2.Section 6 of the Evidence Ordinance (Chapter 14)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended in the illustration (b) to that section, by thesubstitution for the words, \u201cwaging war against the Queen.\u201dof the words, \u201cwaging war against the Republic\u201d.\n\n3.Section 10 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in the illustration to that section, by the substitutionfor the words, \u201c \u2018A\u2019 has joined in a conspiracy to wage waragainst the Queen\u201d of the words, \u201c \u2018A\u2019 has joined in aconspiracy to wage war against the Republic\u201d.\n\n4.Section 37 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:-"
