evail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section 2of Act,No. 13 of2006.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n2Economic Service Charge (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
