    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nKANDYAN MARRIAGE AND DIVORCE (REPEAL)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 317]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. (Ven.) Athuraliye Rathana Thero, M.P.on 21st of January, 2020\n\n(Published in the Gazette on January 07, 2020)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto repeal the Kandyan Marriage and Divorce Act, No. 44 of 1952\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n1Kandyan Marriage and Divorce (Repeal)\n\nAN ACT TO REPEAL THE KANDYAN MARRIAGE AND DIVORCEACT, NO. 44 OF 1952\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kandyan Marriage andDivorce (Repeal) Act, No. of 2020.\n\n2.The Kandyan Marriage and Divorce Act, No. 44 of1952 is hereby repealed.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nAmendmentof thepreamble ofthe Principleenactment.\n\nRepeal ofAct, No. 44of 1952.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n2Kandyan Marriage and Divorce (Repeal)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
