    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of January 09, 2020\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 14.01.2020)\n\nECONOMIC SERVICE CHARGE (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Finance, Economic andPolicy Development\n\nto amend the Economic Service Charge Act, No. 13 of 2006\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 2 of the Economic Service Charge Act, No. 13of 2006 and the legal effect of the section as amended is to remove the Economic ServiceCharge from January 1, 2020.\n\nEconomic Service Charge (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 62/2019\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE ECONOMIC SERVICE CHARGEACT, NO.13 OF 2006\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Economic Service Charge(Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Economic Service Charge Act, No.13 of 2006 is hereby amended in subsection (1) by thesubstitution for the words \u201cbe charged from every person andevery partnership for every quarter of every year ofassessment\u201d, of the words and figures \u201cbe charged from everyperson and every partnership for every quarter of every yearof assessment prior to January 1, 2020 \u2014\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section 2of Act,No. 13 of2006.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n2Economic Service Charge (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
