    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of December 13, 2019\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 18.12.2019)\n\nCIVIL PROCEDURE CODE (AMENDMENT)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Dr.) (Mrs.) Thusitha Wijemanna,M.P. for Kegalle District\n\nto amend the Civil Procedure Code ( Section 627)\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Member's Bill)\n\nCivil Procedure Code (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CIVIL PROCEDURE CODE (SECTION 627)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Civil Procedure Code(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.\n\n2.Section 627 of the Civil Procedure Code is amendedto remove the words \u201cbetween persons professing Islam\u201dand replace such words with the words \u201cin terms of theMuslim Marriage and Divorce Act\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section627.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n2Civil Procedure Code (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
