    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of November 29, 2019\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 29.11.2019)\n\nAPPROPRIATION (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Finance,Economic and Policy Development.\n\nto amend the Appropriation Act, No. 6 of 2019\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends paragraph (b) of subsection (1) of section 2 of theAppropriation Act, No. 6 of 2019, and the legal effect of section as amended is to increasethe borrowing limit of rupees two thousand seventy nine billion to rupees two thousandtwo hundred and seventy nine billion.\n\nAppropriation (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 58/2019\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE APPROPRIATION ACT, NO. 6 OF 2019\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Appropriation(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 6 of 2019 ishereby amended in paragraph (b) of subsection (1) thereof,by the substitution for the words \u201crupees two thousandseventy nine billion\u201d of the words \u201crupees two thousandtwo hundred and seventy nine billion\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section 2of theAppropriationAct, No. 6 of2019.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n2Appropriation (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
